{"parse": {"title": "RF-4", "pageid": 89558, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/RF-3\" title=\"RF-3\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RF-4</span><a href=\"/wiki/RF-5\" title=\"RF-5\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">4</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.AB.98.E6.B8.A9.E4.BB.A5.E5.A4.96\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"高温以外\">高温以外</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 高温以外</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Beyond the Flame</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>走格子前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>走格子后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我注视着她成为一簇明亮的火。从一颗小石子的大小，胀到手掌都快要盛放不下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>火焰永远都在变化，外层的辉光片刻不息地摇曳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>偶尔，火会灼痛自身，会沮丧，会黯淡。但我们的本质仍是燃烧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun4\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun4.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun4.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun4.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我成功地更靠近她了吗？还是更远了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我想我的火焰的确比之前更明亮，我也能看清她衣服的图案了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>小火还是喜欢鲜艳的色彩，她总是那么直接。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火焰铺展的道路又向前迈进了一小段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>一会儿我得先抖抖身上的灰，确保自己还是一朵亮眼的、橙红的火……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>宝贝，你醒了吗？你的那群小朋友们在外面等着了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>桌上有沙拉和牛奶，其他吃的都放在冰箱里，我们晚上回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>你得知道，亲爱的，可没有哪位职业拳手会打算睡到大中午的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-620610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-620610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-620610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲的脚步声远去了，年轻的孩子含糊地呜咽着，翻了个身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……唔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>台下的欢呼声，教练的赞许，拳套里的汗水都逐渐远去，骑着树枝飞舞的愉快记忆也一点点儿溜走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群的喝彩转为稚嫩的呼唤，正从窗外钻进被压痛的耳朵。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>嗯……？嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被子下伸出一只手，抓住闹钟拖入其中。紧接着，小姑娘尖叫着从床铺上弹了起来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>怎么已经这个时间了——！真糟糕……我和大家约好了的，这下我一定迟到了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>妈咪……妈咪是不是来叫过我来着？我做梦了吗？天啊——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她跌跌撞撞地爬向窗边，一把打开窗户，向外探出脑袋——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>请等等我！就等一小会，我不小心睡过头了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>相熟的朋友们正在楼下，笑嘻嘻的闹成一团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨姆：</div><div>瞌睡虫！瞌睡虫！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米娅：</div><div>别着急，小火！我们也刚到呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我——我先刷个牙——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0riverside.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0riverside\"><img alt=\"0riverside\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/600px-Cg-0riverside.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/900px-Cg-0riverside.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/1200px-Cg-0riverside.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米娅：</div><div>小火，以前你都起个大早等在门口的，是最近的练习太累了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到朋友关切的询问，女孩儿不好意思地挠了挠头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>嘿嘿……昨天晚饭的时候，我咬着三明治睡着了，把爸爸和妈咪都吓了一跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>但是我睡得很香！训练完心里就会很踏实，手也暖洋洋的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>你们呢？我前几天听到大家说，附近马上就要举办青少年网球赛——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米娅：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>温柔的姑娘沉默了几秒钟，她转开视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米娅：</div><div>作业，志愿活动，这些就让我忙得够呛……下个季度我就不参加网球训练了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨姆：</div><div>嗨，我也差不多！我得专心野营和钓鱼，好在下次度假的时候炫耀一把。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨姆：</div><div>要是钓到一条十几斤的大鱼，那群小子保准崇拜我一整年！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨姆：</div><div>你想试试吗？要不我们今天下午就去湖边，怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我？我还得去练拳，对不起，萨姆……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨姆：</div><div>哦——抱歉，我也忘了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们仍旧是朋友，仍旧长得和过去一样，没有人忽然变成了“其他孩子”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可是——可燃点低下头，用手指摩擦着挂在腰间的拳击手套，可是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎某种改变，已经发生在了他们身上。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>晚餐的炖菜与鸽子肉那样香甜，但依旧填不满姑娘的心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>和妈咪一起吃了晚饭，和朋友们见了面，去了训练馆……今天也是充实的一天。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun2\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她喃喃自语，将脊背贴在门板上，脚边门缝的下侧，走廊的光照与房中的暖黄色相融。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我的朋友……都有自己的生活，我也是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我……并不为我的选择后悔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>这是必须的吗？人与人之间，会这样轻易地改变吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点抬起头，望向房顶，台灯柔和的光折射在窗边的相框上，将一片轻盈的亮斑反射上天花板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我即将面对一场真正的比赛啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻轻地、轻轻地与自己说。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>冠军会拥有一条腰带，一条金色的腰带……不是纯金的，也不是镀金的，它只是金色的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>这是一场友谊赛，但无论如何，那依然是一条“金腰带”。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个词已不再像最初那样遥远。只要像摘树叶那样高高跳起，似乎就能捕获它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但压力也紧随其后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……我会恐惧我的对手吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……我会愧对那些期望吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她按灭了那盏亮得扰眼的灯，倒在床铺上，想着这些尚未得出答案的问题。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我只是个小孩子，我——我还没有真正地站上过拳击台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>你是最出色的祭司，最棒的伙伴和我最重要的朋友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>如果我的表现不够好，教练会不会建议我退出训练？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我相信你，小火！我会尽我所能地帮助你，把我的火焰分享给你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>他们说，神秘学家的体能大多都不如人类，我做的练习究竟能不能抹平先天的差距？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>别这样沮丧，我看到了你的努力——你还记得乌卢鲁运动会的初衷吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我记得那个声音，它与我的话语一块儿在岩石间回响……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-307610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-307610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-307610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>和平，友爱，公正……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……互助，健康。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>运动本该如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎有一团火焰在胃里烧灼，涌动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又因为这份犹豫无声地平息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她侧过身子，将脸颊紧紧贴在蓬松的枕头上，闭起眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我想得太多了，这些念头都帮不上我的忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>还不如早点休息，再爬起来多做两组脚步练习……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-620612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-620612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-620612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>最后的结果，总得自己试过才知道……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>按耐住胃部的灼热感，她努力平复心情，希望自己尽快坠入梦乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>睡吧，睡吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>睡吧……可燃点……</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RF-4"}}